<title>UK: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the English</p>
<p>premier league after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>13 - Ian Wright (Arsenal)</p>
<p>9 - Robbie Fowler (Liverpool), Fabrizio Ravanelli</p>
<p>(Middlesbrough), Alan Shearer (Newcastle)</p>
<p>8 - Matthew Le Tissier (Southampton), Dwight Yorke</p>
<p>(Aston Villa), Efan Ekoku (Wimbledon), Gianluca</p>
<p>Vialli (Chelsea)</p>
<p>7 - Les Ferdinand (Newcastle), Robbie Earle</p>
<p>(Wimledon)</p>
</text>
